<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sierra Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sierra Semiconductor.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it has reinstated coverage of Sierra Semiconductor Corp with a strong buy rating following the company's report of a fourth quarter profit versus a year-earlier loss.</p>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said bookings in the network arena have improved in recent weeks and appear to be strengthening in January.</p>
<p>-- Also it expects gross margins to expand as Sierra transitions to pure network infrastructure.</p>
<p>-- Sierra shares were up 2-7/64 at 15-63/64 at mid-morning.</p>
</text>
